{"baseRefName":"v1","body":"## 目的\n\nIssue #188 のHost進行型「合同プレー／大会」モードを追加します。\n\nRefs #188\n\n## 変更点\n\n- 通常ROOMとは分離したHost Eventのshared contract、状態機械、HTTP/WS経路、Durable Object永続化を追加\n- 合同プレー／大会、最大20人、専任／兼任Host、途中参加、固定N・同点・欠場配点を実装\n- 未確定score非公開、Host切断300秒、alarm・再起動・冪等再送・履歴paging/resyncを実装\n- Clientへ開催作成／参加／進行／結果／履歴、source連携、未準備・障害表示、レスポンシブUIを追加\n- ROOM COMMENTと同じ開催名制約（空欄可、最大80文字、改行不可、保存時no-trim）を採用\n- Host Event統合・実Tauri E2E・visual fixtureを追加し、CI検証面へ組み込み\n- FSM、WS protocol、data model、screen/source/constants、regression guardの規範文書を更新\n\n## 非変更点\n\n- 通常ARENA/BPL/BPL4のprotocol、成績、通常開催履歴の保存形式は変更しない\n- 新しいCloudflare binding／migration／外部依存は追加しない\n- deploy、release、Issue closeは本PR作成時点では行わない\n\n## 影響範囲\n\n- `packages/shared`: Host Event専用model／message／constants\n- `apps/worker`: Host Event API、ROOM_DO内の別record、状態・alarm・復元\n- `apps/client`: Host Event UI、WS/store、source提出、Tauri開催履歴\n- `scripts` / `testdata`: Host Event統合・実Tauri・visual検証\n- `.github/workflows`: design contract、client unit、Host Event integration、Rust testを追加\n\n## 検証内容\n\n- `npm run check:agents`\n- `npm run check:design-contracts`\n- `npm run lint`\n- `npm run typecheck`\n- `npm run build:client`\n- `npm run test:client-stats`\n- `npm --workspace @infinitas/client run test` — 121/121 PASS\n- `npm run test:worker` — 156/156 PASS\n- `npx tsx --test scripts/host-event-e2e.test.mjs` — 4/4 PASS\n- `cargo check` / `cargo test` — 19/19 PASS\n- `npx wrangler deploy --dry-run`\n- `git diff --check`、UTF-8 no BOM検査\n- 独立contract audit／implementation audit — Blocker 0、Must fix 0、最終PASS\n\n## E2E・回帰確認\n\n- CASUAL（専任Host）／TOURNAMENT（兼任Host）を実Tauri各2曲で完走\n- Host切断後約4秒で再JOINし、次曲進行・最終結果・履歴再読込まで確認\n- 専任Host+20人、兼任Host+19人、overflow拒否を統合試験で確認\n- 0人・20人・source障害・Host切断・同点・欠場・長い表示名をdesktop/mobile実描画で確認し、横overflowなし\n- 通常ARENA 2試合、mixed source BPL、BPL4実Tauri回帰を確認\n\n## 互換性\n\n- 変更はadditive。`EVENT_*`とHost Event record/historyは通常room／通常成績から分離\n- 同じ`ROOM_DO` bindingを使用するが、新migrationは不要\n- `HOST_EVENT_ACCEPT_NEW`は未指定／falseで新規受付停止。既存開催の復帰・進行・結果回収は維持\n- 旧serverではcapabilities確認によりHost Event操作を無効化\n\n## Rollback\n\n1. `HOST_EVENT_ACCEPT_NEW=false`で新規開催受付を停止\n2. 活動中開催の終了・結果保存を待つ\n3. 既存開催recordを保護した状態でclient/serverを戻す\n\n活動中の開催を残した無条件server rollbackは行いません。\n\n## 残余事項\n\n- Hosted CIはPR作成後に実行\n- 破損recordが`restoreLost`になった後の隔離・保持期限・cleanup方針は別途仕様判断が必要（現状はfail-closed）\n- 20個のTauriプロセス同時起動は行わず、20接続DO統合試験とdesktop/mobile実描画で検証\n","comments":[],"files":[{"path":".github/workflows/validate-reusable.yml","additions":14,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/client/package.json","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/client/src-tauri/src/commands/event_result.rs","additions":63,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/client/src-tauri/src/commands/mod.rs","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/client/src-tauri/src/lib.rs","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/client/src/app/App.tsx","additions":126,"deletions":11,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/client/src/components/AppSidebar.tsx","additions":20,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/client/src/dev/event-visual-scenarios.test.ts","additions":25,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/client/src/dev/event-visual-scenarios.ts","additions":96,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/client/src/features/event/EventCreateModal.tsx","additions":187,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/client/src/features/event/EventFinalReview.test.tsx","additions":32,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/client/src/features/event/EventFinalReview.tsx","additions":21,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/client/src/features/event/EventHostInvite.test.tsx","additions":16,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/client/src/features/event/EventHostInvite.tsx","additions":37,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/client/src/features/event/event-name.test.ts","additions":23,"deletions":0,"cha